#: fc-retirement-savings-calculator.php:1707
msgid "AC Retirement Savings Calculator by AccurateCalculators.com"
msgstr "AC pensinio taupymo skaičiuoklė pagal AccurateCalculators.com"

#: fc-retirement-savings-calculator.php:1709
msgid "AC Retirement Savings Calculator Plugin"
msgstr "AC pensinio taupymo skaičiuoklės įskiepis"

#. Plugin Name of the plugin/theme
msgid "AC Retirement Savings Calculator"
msgstr "AC pensinio taupymo skaičiuoklė"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin/theme. Do not translate the URL.
msgid "https://AccurateCalculators.com/calculator-plugins/retirement-savings-plus-plugin"
msgstr "https://AccurateCalculators.com/calculator-plugins/retirement-savings-plus-plugin"

#. Description of the plugin/theme
msgid "A responsive retirement investment calculator with date-based investment schedule and charts. Calculate the investment amount you'll need to reach your retirement goal. Rebrand with your name. Supports 90 currencies, 6 date formats, and 15 languages. Highly customizable via extensive configuration options. Version 2.0 is a major update—test before upgrading."
msgstr "Reaguojanti pensijų investicijų skaičiuoklė su datos pagrindu sudarytu investicijų grafiku ir diagramomis. Apskaičiuokite investicijų sumą, reikalingą jūsų pensijos tikslui pasiekti. Pakeiskite prekės ženklą savo vardu. Palaiko 90 valiutų, 6 datos formatus ir 15 kalbų. Labai pritaikoma per išplėstines konfigūracijos parinktis. 2.0 versija yra didelis atnaujinimas – išbandykite prieš atnaujindami."

#. Author of the plugin/theme Do not translate the domain.
msgid "AccurateCalculators.com"
msgstr "AccurateCalculators.com"

#. Author URI of the plugin/theme. Do not translate the URL.
msgid "https://AccurateCalculators.com"
msgstr "https://AccurateCalculators.com"

